<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">phm.txt Māori macronized text, extracted 20-01-03</book>
  <para style="h">Pirimona</para>
  <para style="toc3">Prmn</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ko te Tuhituhi a Pāora Āpōtoro ki a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Pirimona</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s">He Mihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Nā Pāora, nā te herehere a Karaiti Īhu, nā tō tāua teina hoki, nā Tīmoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Ki tā māua e aroha nei ki tō māua hoa mahi, ki a Pirimona, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />ki a Apia hoki, ki tō māua tuahine, ki tō māua hoa hōia, ki a Arakipu, ki te hāhi hoki i tōu whare:<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Kia tau te aroha noa ki a koutou, me te rangimārie, he mea nā te Atua, nā tō tātou Matua, nā te Ariki hoki, nā Īhu Karaiti.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Aroha me te Whakapono o Pirimona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Tēnei ahau te whakawhetai atu nei ki tōku Atua, mau tonu tōku mahara ki a koe i āku karakiatanga. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />He rongo nōku ki tōu aroha, ki tōu whakapono ki te Ariki, ki a Īhu, ā, ki te hunga tapu katoa. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Mō te whakahoatanga mai o tōu whakapono kia whai mana, i runga i te mātauranga ki ngā pai katoa i roto i a koutou, he mea ki a Karaiti Īhu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />He nui hoki tō mātou koa, mārie ana hoki te ngākau i tōu aroha, nō te mea e ora ana ngā ngākau o te hunga tapu i a koe, e tōku teina.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">He Tono mō Onehimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Heoi, ahakoa he nui tōku māia i roto i a te Karaiti ki te whakatakoto atu i te mea tika ki a koe. <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />Nā te aroha kē tāku ka īnoi atu nei, arā tāku, tā te koroheke, tā Pāora, he herehere nei ināianei nā Īhu Karaiti. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />He kupu tēnei nāku ki a koe mō tāku tamaiti, mō Onehimu, he mea whānau nāku i ahau nei i te herehere. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />I mua, kāhore tētahi mea pai ana ki a koe; ināianei ia, kua whai pai koe i a ia, ahau anō hoki.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Kua whakahokia atu nei ia e ahau, tōna tinana tonu, ko tōku manawa ake ia. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />I mea anō ahau kia puritia ia ki ahau, hei whakakapi mōu ki te mahi ki ahau i roto i ngā mekameka o te rongopai. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Otirā, kāhore nei tāu kupu, kīhai ahau i pai kia meatia tētahi mea; kei riro whakauaua mai tōu pai; engari i roto anō i te ngākau.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Ko te mea anō pea tēnei i motuhia mai ai ia i a koe mō tētahi wā, kia mau pū ai ia i a koe ake ake. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Ehara i te mea hei pono­nga ia i ēnei wā, engari tērā atu i te pono­nga, he teina i nui rawa ai tōku aroha, tērā ia e nui rawa atu tōu, i te kiko­kiko, i te Ariki anō hoki.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Nā, ki te mea kua waiho ahau hei hoa mōu, manako mai ki a ia me te mea ko ahau. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Ki te mea ia kua hē ia ki tētahi mea āu, kei a ia rānei tētahi mea āu, waiho mai māku tēnā e whaka­aro. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />He tuhi­tuhi tēnei nāku, nā Pāora, nā tōku ringa­ringa ake; māku e whaka­utu. Nā, kāhore āku mea­tanga atu ki a koe, tērā anō tāku taonga kei a koe, ko koe anō. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Āe rā, e tōku teina, kia whai pai ahau i a koe i roto i te Ariki; kia ora tōku ngākau i roto i te Ariki.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />He ū nō tōku whaka­aro ki a koe ka ngohe­ngohe, i tuhi­tuhi atu ai ahau ki a koe, e mōhio ana hoki, tērā e nui atu tāu e mea ai i tāku e kōrero atu nei. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Tēnei anō hoki, kia rite mai i a koe tētahi whare mōku; e mea ana hoki ahau tērā e mana ā koutou īnoi, ā, ka tukua atu ahau ki a koutou.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Poroporoaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Tēnei te oha atu nei ki a koe a Epapara, tōku hoa herehere i roto i a Karaiti Īhu, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />rātou tahi ko Māka, ko Aritaku, ko Rīmaha, ko Ruka, ōku hoa mahi.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Kia tau te aroha noa o tō tātou Ariki, o Īhu Karaiti ki ō koutou wairua. Āmine.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>